        <article class="article-card">
          <div class="art-media"><img src="/assets/majestic/blog-2.png" alt="Modern & Classic" /></div>
          <div class="art-meta"><span>Aug 31, 2026</span> • <span>1 min read</span></div>
          <h3 class="art-title">How to Mix Modern and Classic Furniture Like a Pro</h3>
          <p class="art-excerpt">Learn how to confidently mix modern and classic furniture styles to create interiors that feel curated.</p>
